This round found 10 issues, and I ran nothing past them to confirm them. I reproduced the template execution in the first finding on mise 2026.9.12, and I checked the quote-printing behind the third finding the same way. Some of these repeat earlier rounds. The detect quoting, the macOS re-ask, the machine_env check with no fragment, and the mixed-quote refusal were all flagged or recorded as gaps before. The template-execution finding and its misleading-message variant are new this round. The run log hands the stale docs (the "eight assertions" count in `CLAUDE.md` and `.claude/docs/repo-shape.md`, and the `site/` `binaries: [xcodebuild, swift]` text) to U8 in wave 3, so I left them out.
